71"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 0.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1967649/000162828026033871/0001628280-26-033871-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033871"},{"text":"Debt of $1.1bn against equity of $867.2m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1967649/000162828026033871/0001628280-26-033871-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-033871"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.0% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1967649/000207188926000004/0002071889-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -16.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.16,"consecutive":2,"current":-0.009,"current_display":"-0.9%","threshold_display":"-16.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":0.01,"current_display":"1.0%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Debt to equity 